        {
            "_id": "Bf6TFMGAKLYyaBjp",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Master of the Fields",
            "sort": 1100000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Where poludnicas walk, the crops grows rich and tall, and where the poludnicas bury their victims, the corn never suffers from blight or weevils. A field (usually a few square miles) where a poludnica is in residence never suffers from random accidents such as vermin or disease, and any checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Earn Income] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Subsist] off the field gain a +2 circumstance bonus. A poludnica must spend a week in a place before these benefits occur.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
