                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A creature can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Make an Impression] on a poludnica by using Nature ([[/act make-an-impression skill=nature]]), Society ([[/act make-an-impression skill=society]]), or a suitable Lore skill to pose a riddle or answer the poludnica's riddles. In addition to the usual effects of Make an Impression, a creature that succeeds at this check receives a +1 status bonus to saves against the poludnica's spells and sunstroke haze aura (+2 on a critical success). On a failure, they take a –1 status penalty instead (–2 on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.Effect: Riddle Lover]</p>"
                },
