                    "value": "<p>10 feet. A poludnica is surrounded by a shimmering haze of light and heat. Any creature that enters or begins its turn in the emanation must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:26] save. Regardless of the result, the creature doesn't need to make further saves against sunstroke haze for 1 minute. During the hour when the sun is at its zenith, even if the poludnica can't see it, the emanation increases to 30 feet.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fatigued] and is enfeebled 1 for as long as it's fatigued.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2}.</p>"
                },
